<title>USA: Interlake stake raised by Dickstein group.</title>
<headline>Interlake stake raised by Dickstein group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including New York investment firm Dickstein &amp; Co said Friday it raised its stake in Interlake Corp to 5.5 percent, or 1,267,200 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently bought shares of the Lisle, Ill.-based company between June 12 and July 16 at prices ranging from $4.00 to $4.63 a share.</p>
</text>
